From: =?UTF-8?q?Mah=C3=A9=20Audineau?= <mahe.audineau@etudiant.univ-lr.fr>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:20:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Switch 2 0.1.4: no out of memory on level restart, xBRZ on
 all CPU cores

- texture eviction and warm-up budget read the heap's own counters
  (mallinfo reports nothing under mimalloc); eviction from 5.5 GB on the
  Switch 2 (rd_defaults_rev 6)
- textures a restarted level no longer needs are destroyed before the new
  ones are created
- warm-up counts upscaled pictures at their real size
- parallel_for on the process's CPU cores (nx2_parallel.cpp)
- error.log goes to logs/; rdoom.log records the graphics release and the
  process core mask

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
